OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G2100FThe Folk Show with Mark Radcliffe
OL,5,     GThe best folk music. Kris Drever
OL,6,     Gintroduces his new album, Doing
OL,7,     GThis For Love.
OL,8,G2200FThe Good Groove with DJ Spoony
OL,9,     GFeel-good tunes to make you
OL,10,     Ggroove, from soulful house to
OL,11,     GRnB, disco to doo-wop and
OL,12,     Geverything else in-between. Join
OL,13,     Gin with addictive guessing game
OL,14,     G'Music Is The Answer'.
OL,15,G0000FOJ Borg
OL,16,     GOJ is live from Salford, asking
OL,17,     Gabout your Anecd-idn'ts, the
OL,18,     Gthings that never happened in
OL,19,     Gyour life but you've daydreamed
OL,20,     Gabout them, wished them to be
OL,21,     Gtrue.
